Maintainer: Rodrigo M. R. de Medeiros <rodrigo.matheus@ufrn.br>
Description: Description: Implements an Expectation-Maximization (EM) algorithm for maximum 
    likelihood estimation in the Correlated Destructive Negative Binomial Cure 
    Rate (CDNBCR) model. This model describes the time until a specific event 
    occurs (e.g., patient survival times) while accounting for the presence 
    of a cure fraction. It assumes that the event occurs due to multiple 
    competing causes, which may be correlated.
